1
00:00:00,084 --> 00:00:01,572
Pinang ini...

2
00:00:01,572 --> 00:00:04,425
ternyata sudah dipakai
manusia sejak zaman es.

3
00:00:04,425 --> 00:00:05,239
Buktinya:

4
00:00:05,239 --> 00:00:07,147
gigi manusia purba Sulawesi...

5
00:00:07,147 --> 00:00:09,916
berumur hingga 25.000 tahun.

6
00:00:09,916 --> 00:00:11,581
Giginya rusak parah...

7
00:00:11,581 --> 00:00:13,293
dengan lekukan bulat yang aneh.

8
00:00:13,293 --> 00:00:14,322
Rupanya,

9
00:00:14,322 --> 00:00:16,155
bekas mengemut pinang utuh...

10
00:00:16,155 --> 00:00:17,315
bertahun-tahun.

11
00:00:17,315 --> 00:00:19,392
Zat pinangnya bahkan masih tersisa!

12
00:00:19,392 --> 00:00:20,318
Diduga,

13
00:00:20,318 --> 00:00:21,765
pinang itu obat...

14
00:00:21,765 --> 00:00:22,713
sakit gigi.

15
00:00:22,713 --> 00:00:24,790
Ini bukti tertua di dunia...

16
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:27,371
manusia memakai tumbuhan
yang memengaruhi otak!

17
00:00:27,371 --> 00:00:29,967
Tag temanmu yang hobi makan pinang!
